  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759062,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 10-Yard Fight: NES - A Retro Football Experience\n\nStep onto the gridiron with *10-Yard Fight* for the Nintendo Entertainment System, a unique and fast-paced American football game that broke from the traditional playbook. Originally an arcade hit, this NES port retains the core gameplay of its predecessor while adding new features. \n\nPlayers experience a top-down, vertical scrolling perspective, controlling the quarterback and choosing one defensive player while the computer handles the rest of the team. Forget complex play selection – *10-Yard Fight* embraces an \"option offense\" style, allowing you to run, pass, or hand off the ball on every play. Defensive gameplay involves strategically choosing which player to control, relying on the computer to manage the rest of the team. \n\nThe game features five escalating difficulty levels, from high school to the Super Bowl, and supports a simultaneous two-player mode. While simpler than modern football games, *10-Yard Fight* offered a fresh approach to the genre, paving the way for future titles and earning a reputation as a classic. Experience a piece of gaming history with this arcade-inspired football adventure!"
    },
